<article class="read">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="hand big nolead">Last updated: September 29, 2026</p>
  <p>CodeOrbit ("we", "us", "our") operates this site. This page explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have. By using the site, you agree to the practices described here.</p>

  <h2 class="sub" style="font-size:1.6rem">Information we collect</h2>
  <p>You don't need an account to browse tools, snippets, the blog or MemeLearn. We collect a limited amount of information automatically:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Basic usage data, such as pages visited</li>
    <li>Anything you submit through the <a href="/contact">contact form</a> (name, email, message)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="sub" style="font-size:1.6rem">Cookies</h2>
    <p>CodeOrbit uses a small functional cookie for the private admin area. If you click a like button, we also store a random anonymous ID in a cookie (no personal information) so each visitor can like an item once. We also use Google Analytics to understand which pages are useful, but only if you click “Accept” on the cookie banner; nothing is loaded before that. You can change your choice at any time with “Cookie settings” in the footer. If we add advertising (such as Google AdSense), this page will be updated first and consent will be requested before ad cookies are set.</p>

  <h2 class="sub" style="font-size:1.6rem">How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To operate, maintain and improve the site</li>
    <li>To respond to messages sent through the contact form</li>
    <li>To understand which content is useful, in aggregate</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

  <h2 class="sub" style="font-size:1.6rem">Data retention</h2>
  <p>Contact form messages are kept only as long as needed to respond to your enquiry.</p>

  <h2 class="sub" style="font-size:1.6rem">Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can disable cookies in your browser at any time. Doing so should not affect core site features.</p>

  <h2 class="sub" style="font-size:1.6rem">Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>CodeOrbit is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

  <h2 class="sub" style="font-size:1.6rem">Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted here with an updated date.</p>

  <h2 class="sub" style="font-size:1.6rem">Contact us</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy? Reach out through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
</article>
